          "ar": "A rare opportunity to own a prestigious standalone villa in the heart of \"Oriana 2,\" the most sought-after residential enclave within Cairo Festival City (CFC). This property offers expansive living spaces and architectural elegance, providing the perfect canvas for you to design your dream home with your personal touch (Semi-Finished).\n\nNestled in a community that redefines luxury, this villa ensures maximum privacy and security, all while being just minutes away from world-class shopping, dining, and international business hubs.\n\nProperty Specifications:\n\nLocation: New Cairo – Cairo Festival City (Oriana 2).\n\nLand Area: 690 sqm.\n\nBuilt-up Area (BUA): 417 sqm.\n\nCondition: Semi-Finished.\n\nInternal Layout:\n\n6 Spacious Bedrooms (Versatile distribution).\n\nGrand Reception & Dining areas.\n\nDedicated spaces for a private garden and outdoor living.\n\nExceptional Features:\n Strategic Location: Heart of the Fifth Settlement, walking distance to Cairo Festival City Mall, IKEA, and top-tier international schools.\n Absolute Privacy: A massive private garden surrounding the villa, ideal for family gatherings and serene living.\n Investment Value: Oriana villas represent one of the highest appreciating real estate assets in Egypt.\n Elite Community: 24/7 advanced security, professional facility management, and a vibrant, upscale neighborhood.\n\nFinancial Details:\n\nAsking Price: $1,900,000 USD.\n\nProperty Code: OR2-6R-1.9M$"
        },
